 "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/PaywallOverrides"},{"type":"text","text":" object whose parameters override the paywall defaults. Use this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to override products and whether it ignores the subscription status. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"paywallOverrides"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional completion block that gets called when the paywall should dismiss. This defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" and the SDK"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will call "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"presentationMode.wrappedValue.dismiss()"},{"type":"text","text":" by default. Otherwise you must perform the dismissal of the paywall."}]}],"name":"onRequestDismiss"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A completion block that accepts an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Error"},{"type":"text","text":" and returns a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":". This will show when the requested"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paywall is skipped. Defaults to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EmptyView()"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"name":"onErrorView"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A completion block containing a feature that you wish to paywall. Access to this block is remotely configurable via the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com\/dashboard"},{"type":"text","text":". If the paywall is set to "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Non Gated"}]},{"type":"text","text":", this will be called when"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the paywall is dismissed or if the user is already paying. If the paywall is "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Gated"}]},{"type":"text","text":", this will be called only if the user is already paying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or if they begin paying. If no paywall is configured, this gets called immediately. This will not be called in the event of an error."}]}],"name":"feature"}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This uses "},{"code":"Superwall\/getPaywall(forPlacement:params:paywallOverrides:delegate:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" under the hood."}]},{"style":"warning","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You’re responsible for the deallocation of this view. If you have a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" presented somewhere"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and you try to present the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PaywallView"},{"type":"text","text":" elsewhere, you will get a crash."}]}],"name":"Warning"}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/PaywallView"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A SwiftUI paywall view that you can embed into your app."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/paywallview\/init(placement:params:paywalloverrides:onrequestdismiss:onerrorview:feature:)"]}],"references":{"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/PaywallView":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/PaywallView","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text"